    "type": "game",
    "name": "Red Nose Guy The LegenDairy Quest",
    "steam_appid": 2936720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/7e5dd49edfec22fb921d775c0aff55f1.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/7e5dd49edfec22fb921d775c0aff55f1.apng?t=1728463990\" class=\"bb_img\" width=623 height=194 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Red Nose Guy: The LegenDairy Quest</strong> is a modern and high-energy revisit of an arcade classic.<br>Join Red Nose Guy on an adventure through the city's various neighborhoods and discover his colorful and absurd universe!<br><br><i>Red Nose Guy just wants to buy his milk, but to do so, he must travel a long way.<br>The whole world is against him, so help him out!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/99e5063488e21ddb1cc0b9372ae7e0c9.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/99e5063488e21ddb1cc0b9372ae7e0c9.webm?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>How to play</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Launch your grapple to burst the balls,<br></li><li>Each ball hit splits into two smaller balls,<br></li><li>Make all the balls disappear,<br></li><li>Don't exceed the time limit,<br></li><li>Collect bonuses for more points and extra lives.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Experience the arcade challenge with the Story mode</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A time limit per level,<br></li><li>Levels are played sequentially in a single gaming session,<br></li><li>Restart the Story endlessly until you complete it entirely or to improve your score.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Play in Panic mode</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play all 11 levels in one go,<br></li><li>Balls continuously spawn with no time limit,<br></li><li>The further you progress, the harder it gets,<br></li><li>Achieve the highest score and top the leaderboard.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Game Features</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 levels of difficulty,<br></li><li>11 levels per difficulty, each with a unique and animated scenery,<br></li><li>Bonuses, animated characters, increasing difficulty,<br></li><li>Global leaderboard of high scores.</li></ul><br>Complete all the Stories and help Red Nose Guy retrieve his milk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" width=612 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.webm?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.mp4?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/7e5dd49edfec22fb921d775c0aff55f1.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/7e5dd49edfec22fb921d775c0aff55f1.apng?t=1728463990\" class=\"bb_img\" width=623 height=194 /></picture></span><br><br><strong>Red Nose Guy: The LegenDairy Quest</strong> is a modern and high-energy revisit of an arcade classic.<br>Join Red Nose Guy on an adventure through the city's various neighborhoods and discover his colorful and absurd universe!<br><br><i>Red Nose Guy just wants to buy his milk, but to do so, he must travel a long way.<br>The whole world is against him, so help him out!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/99e5063488e21ddb1cc0b9372ae7e0c9.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/99e5063488e21ddb1cc0b9372ae7e0c9.webm?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>How to play</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Launch your grapple to burst the balls,<br></li><li>Each ball hit splits into two smaller balls,<br></li><li>Make all the balls disappear,<br></li><li>Don't exceed the time limit,<br></li><li>Collect bonuses for more points and extra lives.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Experience the arcade challenge with the Story mode</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A time limit per level,<br></li><li>Levels are played sequentially in a single gaming session,<br></li><li>Restart the Story endlessly until you complete it entirely or to improve your score.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Play in Panic mode</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play all 11 levels in one go,<br></li><li>Balls continuously spawn with no time limit,<br></li><li>The further you progress, the harder it gets,<br></li><li>Achieve the highest score and top the leaderboard.</li></ul><br><u><strong>Game Features</strong></u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 levels of difficulty,<br></li><li>11 levels per difficulty, each with a unique and animated scenery,<br></li><li>Bonuses, animated characters, increasing difficulty,<br></li><li>Global leaderboard of high scores.</li></ul><br>Complete all the Stories and help Red Nose Guy retrieve his milk.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.poster.avif?t=1728463990\" width=612 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.webm?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936720/extras/ab0ea29668802c49eb2b493ee05bc58d.mp4?t=1728463990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
